<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SHIGA KOGEN, Japan 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after</p>
<p>the first leg of an alpine skiing men's World Cup giant slalom</p>
<p>on Saturday:</p>
<p>  1. Michael von Gruenigen (Switzerland) one minute 21.88</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>  2. Andreas Schifferer (Austria)     1:22.37</p>
<p>  3. Paul Accola (Switzerlnnd)	  1:22.45</p>
<p>  4. Patrick Holzer (Italy)	     1:22.50</p>
<p>  5. Steve Locher (Switzerland)	 1:22.85</p>
<p>  6. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway)     1:23.16</p>
<p>  7. Didier Plaschy (Switzerland)     1:23.19</p>
<p>  8. Thomas Grandi (Canada)	     1:23.22</p>
<p>  9. Mario Reiter (Austria)	     1:23.34</p>
<p> 10. Fredrik Nyberg (Sweden)	    1:23.40</p>
</text>
